extraction_notes: "Transcribed from Rifts World Book 3: England p.66-69, read off 170 dpi renders. The class is the six-year bond of servitude. The 10- and 14-year servitude tiers start at levels 3 and 5 and change the spell list and the starting level, which a variant cannot carry, so they are stored as prose special_abilities. The Random Insanity Table (printed p.69) is a body section, Random Insanity Table. occ_group magic and men_of_arms false, from the book filing the class under the Temporal Magic heading. Rogue is printed (2%), read as +2%. Lesser protection circle, where the book names one, is held as Protection Circle: Simple. Temporal spell rows stand as the catalog holds them (newest printing wins, Nate 2026-10-04); no spell row was added or changed. Not stored: the mini-oxygen tank and the neuro-mace. The +1 spell strength at levels 2, 5, 9 and 13 and the gems and precious metals are restrictions prose."
