# Temporal Wizard

## Lore

A master manipulator of space and time. The rare temporal spells are closely guarded secrets: most (70%) temporal wizards learn them from a demonic temporal raider, at the price of at least six years of apprenticeship called the bond of servitude, in which the mage learns spell magic and the ways of greed and villainy and is taught temporal magic only in the last year. Many extend the bond as the raider''s partner for four years, and some for four more, to fourteen years in all; then wizard and mentor part ways, often as rivals. Most travel the megaverse with secret sanctuaries and friends in 1D4+1 dimensions. They favour capes and cloaks in black, grey, silver, white and any shade of blue, with a splash of red, amber, gold or purple, and 90% ride an otherdimensional monster, a hover cycle or vehicle, or a jet pack.

## Random Insanity Table

Rolled once by a wizard of the ten-year bond and twice by one of the fourteen-year bond (printed 69). 01-10 Pacifist. 11-15 Phobia: god-like beings, especially alien intelligences. 16-20 Obsessed with fighting and competition. 21-30 Obsession: power. 31-40 Obsession: hates temporal raiders. 41-45 Obsession: timeliness. 46-50 Phobia: terrified of temporal raiders. 51-55 Obsession: danger. 56-60 Obsession: time is meaningless (always 3D6 minutes late). 61-65 Paranoid: creatures of magic. 66-70 The eternal pessimist. 71-75 Cruel streak. 76-80 Paranoid: dimensional travelers. 81-85 Fear of success (-3 initiative, -3 strike, parry and dodge, -15% skills under pressure). 86-90 Obsession: magic. 91-95 Disgusted by anything slimy. 96-00 Phobia: physical transformation.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'temporal-wizard');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'temporal-wizard';

